  "historyNote": ". #5788, eff 2-17-94, EXPIRED: 2-17-00 New. #7212, INTERIM, eff 3-2-00, EXPIRED: 6-30-00 New. #7338, eff 8-2-00; ss by #9217, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12013, eff 10-25-16",
